        <detaileddescription>
<para>Sets Emulation mode for CPU timer.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>base</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>is the base address of the timer module. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>mode</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>is the emulation mode of the timer.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
This function sets the behaviour of CPU timer during emulation. Valid values mode are: CPUTIMER_EMULATIONMODE_STOPAFTERNEXTDECREMENT, CPUTIMER_EMULATIONMODE_STOPATZERO and CPUTIMER_EMULATIONMODE_RUNFREE.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>None. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
